// Staging API (Architecture §15 — per-environment isolation: staging never shares a
// database, Redis instance or bucket with production).
//
// ⚠️ REPLACE `fitwar.app.example` WITH THE REAL DOMAIN before building this
// configuration. `AppConfig` refuses to launch a non-Debug build that still points at a
// `.example` host, so this fails loudly rather than shipping a broken build.
//
// WebSockets follow automatically: `RealtimeClient` derives wss:// from an https base
// URL, so there is no second URL to keep in sync.
API_BASE_URL = https:/$()/staging-api.fitwar.app.example
